{"id":"b0e2f74fa0a4326a","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-T-schema-conditional-validity.md","title":"固定点透明性与双条件指定性","display":"prop-T-schema-conditional-validity — 固定点透明性与双条件指定性","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-T-schema-conditional-validity","aliases":["91-prop-T-schema-conditional-validity","91-prop-T-schema-restricted","91-prop-disquotation-conditional"],"display":"prop-T-schema-conditional-validity — 固定点透明性与双条件指定性","depends_on":["[[91-df-T-schema]]","[[91-df-truth-value-gap]]","[[91-df-strong-kleene]]","[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","[[91-df-jump-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-T-schema-conditional-validity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-T-schema-conditional-validity</span><span>91-prop-T-schema-restricted</span><span>91-prop-disquotation-conditional</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-T-schema-conditional-validity — 固定点透明性与双条件指定性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" href=\"?note=ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" title=\"91-df-T-schema\">91-df-T-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8747011468390705\" href=\"?note=8747011468390705\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-gap\">91-df-truth-value-gap</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fcfe6f023ac58abf\" href=\"?note=fcfe6f023ac58abf\" title=\"91-df-strong-kleene\">91-df-strong-kleene</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2bc1263010e83604\" href=\"?note=2bc1263010e83604\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-function\">91-df-truth-value-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Gamma=J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> (一致强 Kleene 固定点)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span> (固定点评价)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Det}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\nv_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\in\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Det}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\nv_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\in\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Gap}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\nv_\\Gamma(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u\">\\(\\operatorname{Gap}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\nv_\\Gamma(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leftrightarrow_{\\mathrm{SK}}\">\\(\\leftrightarrow_{\\mathrm{SK}}\\)</span> (由强 Kleene 联结词定义的双条件)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}validity}\\vdash\n\\Gamma=J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(\\Gamma)\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\nv_\\Gamma(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))\n=v_\\Gamma(\\varphi),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}validity}\\vdash\n\\Gamma=J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(\\Gamma)\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\nv_\\Gamma(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))\n=v_\\Gamma(\\varphi),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Det}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\n&amp;\\to\nv_\\Gamma\\bigl(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow_{\\mathrm{SK}}\\varphi\\bigr)=\\mathbf t,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Gap}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\n&amp;\\to\nv_\\Gamma\\bigl(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow_{\\mathrm{SK}}\\varphi\\bigr)=\\mathbf u.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Det}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\n&amp;\\to\nv_\\Gamma\\bigl(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow_{\\mathrm{SK}}\\varphi\\bigr)=\\mathbf t,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Gap}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\n&amp;\\to\nv_\\Gamma\\bigl(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow_{\\mathrm{SK}}\\varphi\\bigr)=\\mathbf u.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>固定点在真值层面始终满足透明性：真理原子与被编码句有同一个三值。\n但若“有效”要求公式取得指定值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf t\">\\(\\mathbf t\\)</span>，则强 Kleene 双条件在 gap\n情形取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span>，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf f\">\\(\\mathbf f\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>这一区分是语义陈述，不应直接改写成 “KF 对每个非 gap 句子都证明\nT-schema”。证明论结论还取决于 KF 的公理、句子是否可定义以及如何\n在理论内部表达确定性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-T-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-value-gap","status":"resolved","id":"8747011468390705","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-gap]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-strong-kleene","status":"resolved","id":"fcfe6f023ac58abf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-strong-kleene]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-value-function","status":"resolved","id":"2bc1263010e83604","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma=J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"v_\\Gamma:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\to\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Det}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\nv_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\in\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Gap}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\nv_\\Gamma(\\varphi)=\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\leftrightarrow_{\\mathrm{SK}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}T\\text{-}schema\\text{-}conditional\\text{-}validity}\\vdash\n\\Gamma=J_{\\mathrm{SK}}(\\Gamma)\n\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\,\nv_\\Gamma(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))\n=v_\\Gamma(\\varphi),","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Det}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\n&\\to\nv_\\Gamma\\bigl(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow_{\\mathrm{SK}}\\varphi\\bigr)=\\mathbf t,\\\\\n\\operatorname{Gap}_\\Gamma(\\varphi)\n&\\to\nv_\\Gamma\\bigl(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow_{\\mathrm{SK}}\\varphi\\bigr)=\\mathbf u.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf f","display":false}],"bytes":2062,"backlinks":[{"id":"eb8ec521f1c6bc18","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["ba367ff1b4bb3da3","8747011468390705","fcfe6f023ac58abf","2bc1263010e83604","ae9eced0b12cbd2a"]}